==Strategy==
To kill the Imperator Saels, use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. You can also deal with the Saels by using [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] units such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]]. Le'boin is also a threat of this stage. To kill him, use Crazed Bahamut and any units that outranges him.

